# Abundance: "If you would draw a card, you may instead choose land or nonland and reveal cards from the top of your library
# until you reveal a card of the chosen kind. Put that card into your hand and put all other cards revealed this way on the
# bottom of your library in any order." (CR 614.1a, 121.6, 701.20) "If you use this on a multi-card draw, each replaced draw
# is handled separately" (its ruling): for Ancestral Recall's first draw Bot1 takes the effect and chooses nonland - the
# Forest and the Plains are revealed before Ornithopter, which goes to its hand, and the two lands go to the bottom in the
# order Bot1 gives; for the second it declines, and draws the Island; for the third it takes it and chooses land, and the
# Mountain on top is revealed and taken.

